    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c883ba6e332404af723f588e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "已经习惯毫不保留地用尽全力奔跑的她，\n比赛时总是不顾对手的策略，\n只照自己的意思倾尽全力奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0b1716cdaac2367684ae986fe6b559d83b3630615a6d876e7c611d0327fbf53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
