    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5c145bda51065cd16053543",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "简单来说就是总是想刷新纪录的全力冲刺跑法。\n但现在我们追求的不是Max的速度，\n而是能视状况调整的适当速度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b010fcab00bdd20b3eedc5968356e95852a0221afc84da70d5274c732de89938",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
