        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae794546d57a902914ab81dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而这也并不是光靠油门踩到底就能够做到。\n现在她必须学会能细腻地掌控速度、\n调整步调的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eed468ac663a075080ddf2f1277c1f5d77502107b992990971f316cfb9e2e08d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
